/ item-doors 39: a plural plang reaches is a singular node. A dict's key, read alone, is its first key; `.list` is
/ every key, in the order they were set.
KeyIsTheFirstKey
- set %person% = {"name": "Ada", "age": 36}
- assert %person!key% equals "name"
- assert %person!key.list% equals ["name", "age"]
